    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefine myself? i don't think there's anything left to redefine. it's not just about being lonely. it feels like the \"me\" that existed was actually just a reflection of us. without that mirror, there's just this hollow feeling. like i'm just ghosting through my own life. it's actually exhausting just trying to pretend i'm someone when i feel so empty.",
