    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a gap though. it feels final. like the person i was actually died when he left. i'm just watching the clock tick and waiting for the rest of me to catch up. it's so much easier to just exist as nothingness than to keep trying to build something out of zero. does that even make sense? that it feels like there's no point in even trying to find someone else or a new purpose when the soul of it all is just gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
